# TypeScript

- Keep `strict` and `noUncheckedIndexedAccess` happy.
- Ban `any`; prefer `unknown` then narrow.
- Use Zod at env / external boundaries (`src/env.ts` pattern).
- Prefer named exports for shared modules; keep Phaser scenes as classes extending `Phaser.Scene`.
